## ObjectType: Exposure Contribution

Bridge retaining each distinct position valuation contributing to an issuer numerator, including an explicit blank value when blocked.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| contribution_id | Contribution Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | contribution_id |
| exposure_id | Exposure Id | string | Foreign key to issuer_exposures; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | exposure_id |
| valuation_id | Valuation Id | string | Foreign key to valuation_snapshots; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | valuation_id |
| contribution_amount | Contribution Amount | decimal | USD value copied from one contributing valuation; blank preserves unavailable evidence. | contribution_amount |
| currency | Currency | string | Base currency USD; amounts are expressed in dollars. | currency |

### Keys

Primary Keys: contribution_id
Display Key: contribution_id
